Pre-formatted available display data for Buy/Sell bottom sheet.

Rust computes precision-truncated values (no thousand separators);
Native applies `formatLocalized()` for locale-aware display.

fields.doc:
Fixed-PnL dynamic trigger (BE: type "" none / "amount" / "rate";
val = amount raw USDT / rate decimal fraction, e.g. 0.05 for 5%).
Empty/None = not fixed mode. Sent alongside `new_tp_trigger_px` (the FE-computed price).
